      <description><![CDATA[First release of the native macOS app.<br>
- Proxy several ATEMs at once, each on its own IP address<br>
- Menu bar app with status, clients and log per ATEM<br>
- Finds ATEMs on the network and shows each proxy in ATEM Software Control<br>
- Automatic updates<br>]]></description>
